},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/finish()":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"finish"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"type":"topic","title":"finish()","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/finish()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends tracking: waits for the worker to handle every event already tracked, then ends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" after them, so a delivery sends what is still pending and completes. Events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked afterwards are dropped."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/Records-swift.struct":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Records"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Records"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.struct","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events a tracker tracks, in the order tracked: what a delivery reads.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/Records-swift.struct","type":"topic","title":"Tracker.Records"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"title":"Sampler","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","abstract":[{"text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written","type":"text"},{"tex